<title>UK: Union has received bid approaches.</title>
<headline>Union has received bid approaches.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial services and trading group Union Plc said on Tuesday that it had received several unsolicited approaches over the last few weeks.</p>
<p>The group said in a statement that it would be pursuing discussions with interested parties.</p>
<p>&quot;The board recognises that the interests of shareholders could be best served through a takeover by a company whose own operations can add value to our businesses,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>By 0938 GMT, shares in Union had risen 7p to stand at 93-1/2p.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
